# Applies to builds from the repository root (the single-container image).
# The backend/ and frontend/ folders have their own for the Compose builds.

.git

# Installed and generated files are rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/coverage.out
**/coverage.html
**/bin/

# Local settings must not leak into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
